fixture zone1_10_wall_stops_the_full_kit
doc Control for zone 1 room 10 (tech 10): the walls of the low gaps run from the solid floor to the solid ceiling, so no dash-jump, air jump, air dash or wall-kick passes them. A dash-jump from 700 into gap B's wall, the air jump, an up-forward air dash and wall-kicks, all with the stick held toward it
room zone1/10_crouch_dash_under
spawn 700 960
frames 140
input
  0 R dash
  # A dash-jump: the jump on dash frame 6 keeps the dash speed into the air.
  6 R jump
  # The air jump after it, then the air dash up and forward.
  20 R jump
  30 U R dash
  31..59 R
  # Kicks off the wall's face, then forward again.
  60 R jump
  61..79 R
  80 R jump
  81..99 R
  100 R jump
  101..139 R
end
expect
  at 0 event.dash=1
  at 6 event.jump=1
  never 0..139 x>950u
  never 0..139 event.room=1
end
